Subject: [PATCH 04/14] jails/instances/lab-claude: Pull the whole list into
 the lab-mail profile
To: lab@lists.p7x.dev
Cc: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Change-Id: rqtpmxtxsuowmmtqvolzstywolwzoktn
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:13:53 +0000

lab-claude fetched only INBOX into ~/mail/lists, under a profile with
no hooks and no change id index. A message Pat files in Next, Later,
or Archive then vanished from its view, and the tags lab-process-mail
relies on were never derived.

It now has the same layout as beastie, under claude@p7x.dev:

- mbsync pulls all four of the list's folders. The login is
  read-only, so the sync only pulls and Expunge Near follows
  lab-mail.
- The lab-mail profile replaces the lists one, with the hooks from
  dotfiles/notmuch and flag sync off.
- bootstrap.sh makes the mail root, which mbsync will not create.
